-- Deterministic board for the perf harness: 200 rows so a scroll phase can
-- append several pages. Images point at our own /og.png with a distinct
-- query per card, so byte counts are hermetic and every card is a real
-- request. Chunked because D1 rejects a statement over 100KB, and 200 rows
-- in one INSERT is exactly that. Not a test fixture — see
-- scripts/prep-local-board.sh.
